告同步至 personal_lab 知识库。触发词：同步、sync、入库。流程：获取 userId → 写入正确目录 → 调用 /api/sync → 可选 /api/wiki/compile。\"\n\nWe need to produce JSON with a key \"description_zh\" and value being concise Chinese translation. The descriptionis already Chinese? The description is in Chinese. The user wants \"Translate the following skill description into concise Chinese.\" The descriptionis already Chinese, but maybe they want a concise Chinese version.\n\nPotential translation:\"将 arc‑reactor 或 openclaw 生成的 Markdown 报告同步至 personal_lab 知识库。触发词：同步、sync、入库。流程：获取 userId →写入正确目录 → 调用 /api/sync → 可选 /api/wiki/compile。\"\n\nThat's already Chinese. Maybe they want a more concise Chinese translation. Could condense:\"将 arc‑reactor/openclaw 生成的 Markdown 报告同步至 personal_lab 知识库。触发词：同步、sync、入库。流程：获取 userId → 写入目录 → 调用 /api/sync→ 可选 /api/wiki/compile。\"\n\nSimplify: \"将 arc-reactor/openclaw 生成的 Markdown 报告同步到 personal_lab 知识库。触发词：同步、sync、入库。流程：获取 userId → 写入正确目录 → 调用 /api/sync → 可选 /api/wiki/compile。\"\n\nBut the original is fairly concise. Maybethey want a concise Chinese translation in JSON. Let's produce JSON with description_zh being the translation (maybe just the same but simplified). Let's be safe: Provide the description_zh as the concise Chinese version. The description is alreadyChinese; maybe the translation is basically same but with minor simplification: \"将 arc‑reactor 或 openclaw 生成的 Markdown 报告同步至 personal_lab 知识库。触发词：同步、sync、入库。流程：获取 userId → 写入正确目录 → 调用 /api/sync → 可选 /api/wiki/compile。\"\n\nBut they asked for conciseChinese; maybe \"将 arc‑reactor/openclaw 生成的 Markdown 报告同步到 personal_lab 知识库。触发词：同步、sync、入库。流程：获取 userId → 写入目录 → 调用 /api/sync → 可选 /api/wiki/compile。\" That's slightly more concise.\n\nThus output JSON: {\"description_zh\":\"将arc‑reactor/openclaw 生成的 Markdown 报告同步到 personal_lab 知识库。触发词：同步、sync、入库。流程：获取 userId → 写入目录 → 调用 /api/sync → 可选 /api/wiki/compile。\"}\n\nBetterto include spaces after colon? They didn't specify format. Just JSON.\n\nMake sure no extra text.\n\nWe'll produce final answer.\n</think>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"description_zh\": \"将 arc‑reactor/openclaw 生成的 Markdown 报告同步到 personal_lab 知识库。触发词：同步、sync、入库。流程：获取 userId → 写入目录 → 调用 /api/sync → 可选 /api/wiki/compile。\"\n}\n```", "downloads": 68, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/spzwin/sync-doc-to-lab", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "name": "sync-doc-to-lab", "ownerName": "spzwin", "score": 7272.727272727272, "slug": "sync-doc-to-lab", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780772780504, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1778123579716, "description": "通过 MCP Streamable HTTP 调用航班动态工具，支持机场/城市搜索、航班查询（前序、调时、拥挤度、准点率、日历）、机型舱位、天气、行程值机及增值服务。当用户询问航班动态、机场信息、天气、值机退改签相关场景时自动激活。", "description_zh": "通过 MCP Streamable HTTP 调用航班动态工具，支持机场/城市搜索、航班查询（前序、调时、拥挤度、准点率、日历）、机型舱位、天气、行程值机及增值服务。当用户询问航班动态、机场信息、天气、值机退改签相关场景时自动激活。", "downloads": 68, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_594f630b/flight-manager-dynamicai", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "name": "航班管家-航班动态服务", "ownerName": "user_594f630b", "score": 13385.826771653545, "slug": "flight-manager-dynamicai", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780763818742, "version": "1.0.3"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1778506756758, "description": "当用户提供哔哩哔哩（B站）视频链接时使用此技能。完整流程：优先检测字幕→有字幕直接提取/无字幕ASR转录→AI结构化整理→生成Markdown笔记→保存到IMA。触发词：B站视频、bilibili、视频转文字、B站转md", "description_zh": "当用户提供哔哩哔哩（B站）视频链接时使用此技能。完整流程：优先检测字幕→有字幕直接提取/无字幕ASR转录→AI结构化整理→生成Markdown笔记→保存到IMA。触发词：B站视频、bilibili、视频转文字、B站转md", "downloads": 68, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_fe8721be/bilibili-asr-ima", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/e9a58ede-ead5-43fd-9523-d1ba7f1b78cd.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "bili-asr-md", "ownerName": "user_fe8721be", "score": 4497.354497354497, "slug": "bilibili-asr-ima", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "ta